OL,3,GNEWSABurst main leaves homes without
OL,4,Awater for 12 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been left without water
OL,7,For with low pressure for more than 12
OL,8,Fhours due to a damaged main.
OL,10,FThe incident near Bath in Somerset
OL,11,Fhappened at around 02:00 GMT and
OL,12,Faffected houses in the BA2, BA3 and
OL,13,FBS39 areas in Paulton, Temple Cloud and
OL,14,FClutton.
OL,16,FBristol Water said it had sent out
OL,17,Fcrews in the early hours who were still
OL,18,Ftrying to repair the leak.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
