OL,3,GNEWSABurst main leaves homes without
OL,4,Awater for 12 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson from South West Water,
OL,7,Fwhich owns and operates Bristol Water,
OL,8,Fsaid it was working to fix the issue as
OL,9,Fquickly as possible. It added it was in
OL,10,Fthe process of delivering bottled water
OL,11,Fto its most vulnerable customers and
OL,12,Fsetting up a bottled water station.
